  "Title": "请一如既往地看着我",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 2005705001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "双叶离开以后，我感觉胸口仿佛空了一个大洞。/n可是，时间依旧无情地流逝。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1050",
      "BgmFileName": "404",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在回想起来，我一直都在追逐双叶的影子。/n仿佛拼命想把已经失去的东西重新收集起来。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样的我会坚定成为舞台演员的决心，也是再自然不过的事。/n……因为只有在舞台上，我才能再次感受到那时双叶的笑容。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
