    {
      "Id": 2005705005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "妈妈，爸爸。我将来要成为舞台演员。/n直到现在，这个想法也没有改变。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1261",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050040",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊，将来果然还是要当舞台演员吗。/n看来你的决心没有变。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050050",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你在家里也一直练习演技嘛。/n听说在学校里也会主动组织舞台演出吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，当然会继续演戏。/n也正因如此，我想去银河座……去一流剧团检验自己的实力。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（成为演员……绝不是一条安稳的道路。/n　爸爸妈妈身为父母，不可能完全没有顾虑。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（他们……会接受吗。/n　或者说，就算真的当上演员，我又能一直证明自己的实力吗？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2005705011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2005705,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（……不，这可不像我。把所有不顺眼的东西统统跨过去，/n　只想着献上最棒的表演……我已经和双叶约好了。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20057050100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
